<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>LongBench results for Mistral-7b-instruct-v0.2. The correspondence between abbreviations and datasets is provided in Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Abbreviation-Dataset Mapping ‣ SpindleKV: A Novel KV Cache Reduction Method Balancing Both Shallow and Deep Layers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>. We ensure that the reserve ratio <math id="S3.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> of SpindleKV is slightly lower than the baselines, with the deviation kept within 2%, as our method cannot precisely control the KV cache size.</figcaption>
</figure>
