<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.3 </span>Inference Speed</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We measured the latency on LLaMA3-8B-Instruct and Mistral-7B using a context length of 4096 and a generation length of 1000 on a signal 3090 GPU. The inference speed (token/s) are showed in Table <a href="#A4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ D.2 LongBench Results On More Baselines ‣ Appendix D More Experiment Results ‣ SpindleKV: A Novel KV Cache Reduction Method Balancing Both Shallow and Deep Layers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, our method does not introduce significant additional time overhead during inference, which is consistent with the analysis presented in our paper.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T10" class="ltx_table">
